 rts\n1:00pm Dance Workshops with Backhaus Dance\n*Please note programming 
 lasts 10-30 minutes.\nIncluded in museum admission\, Space is limited! Boo
 k your tickets now.\n*Museum members do not require reservation.\n*Events 
 and dates are subject to change.\nAbout the play partner:\nPlatinum Perfor
 ming Arts is a non-profit dance and theatre studio located in Orange. Our 
 mission focuses on making high-quality performing arts classes and experie
 nces welcoming and accessible to all. Through our inclusion program\, All 
 Abilities classes and scholarship options we hope to help every child shin
 e onstage.\nAbout the play partner: Backhausdance is Orange County&#8217
 \;s award-winning contemporary dance nonprofit dedicated to creating and p
 erforming bold\, innovative work that inspires\, challenges and uplits. T
 hrough transformative education and inclusive community engagement\, we em
 power the next generation of artists and enrich the cultural pulse of Sout
 hern California. Our vision: Dance Every Day for Every Body!  \n&nbsp\;
 \\n\\nMore info: https://www.pretendcity.org/events/grands-and-littles-day
