 sine and traditions.  \nTimes: 11 am &amp\; 2:30 pm\n\nIncluded in museu
 m admission. Space is limited! Book your tickets now.\n*Members do not r
 equire a reservation.\n*Events and dates are subject to change.  \nAbout
  the play partner:\nDr. Griselda Maldonado is a Santa Ana native\, educato
 r\, and bilingual author who celebrates culture through storytelling. Insp
 ired by her family’s journey\, she is dedicated to preserving language a
 nd tradition for future generations.\\n\\nMore info: https://www.pretendci
 ty.org/events/cooking-in-the-city-10/
